 a father?"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"そして父になる","overview":"申し分のない学歴や仕事、良き家庭を、自分の力で勝ち取ってきた良多。順風満帆な人生を歩んできたが、ある日、6年間大切に育ててきた息子が病院内で他人の子どもと取り違えられていたことが判明する。血縁か、これまで過ごしてきた時間かという葛藤の中で、それぞれの家族が苦悩し……。","tagline":"6年間育てた息子は、他人の子でした"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/P4s87wKdXm4d3P448F3kLxEaxb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kpBl6nGmRaUKmvASc1S3hB9F71q.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":177945,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/P4s87wKdXm4d3P448F3kLxEaxb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/P4s87wKdXm4d3P448F3kLxEaxb.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/P4s87wKdXm4d3P448F3kLxEaxb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/P4s87wKdXm4d3P448F3kLxEaxb.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dH2GMnoxHmViKJRnDz8bwCAH2lC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dH2GMnoxHmViKJRnDz8bwCAH2lC.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3GjZHPk8xEoH1c1N0AO6IhgIwRw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3GjZHPk8xEoH1c1N0AO6IhgIwRw.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r0nejXOf6e4leWhnLuEQOmC5hrX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r0nejXOf6e4leWhnLuEQOmC5hrX.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r0nejXOf6e4leWhnLuEQOmC5hrX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r0nejXOf6e4leWhnLuEQOmC5hrX.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},